  charDescription: Mykola Tymchenko is a 25 years old train mechanic, quite good
    at his job too. His family (he have a young daugther and a wife) are already
    above frontier. He stayed behind so he could scrap up some more money to ensure
    his family could make a fresh start. His limping stopped him from joining the
    army, but he's not unhappy about it, as he's not a good shot either. In term
    of character, he is a good guy always ready to help others.
